        "verse": 11
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "LAM",
          "chapter": 4,
          "verse": 11
        }
      ],
      "en": "The LORD has accomplished his wrath. He has poured out his fierce anger. He has kindled a fire in Zion, which has devoured its foundations.",
      "ko": "여호와께서 분을 발하시며 맹렬한 노를 쏟으심이여 시온에 불을 피우사 그 지대를 사르셨도다",
      "source_text_hash": "f94e86d53182653805343108ae3bee72b342d1ca3a9eb03908fee3c8469f243b",
      "translation_text_hash": "836f60f35b8f6735100e7554b223222816a7e1133475b7f2a3eb442e53a26d10",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "여호와께서 분을 발하시며 맹렬한 노를 쏟으심이여 시온에 불을 피우사 그 지대를 사르셨도다"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "836f60f35b8f6735100e7554b223222816a7e1133475b7f2a3eb442e53a26d10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:LAM:4:12",
      "sequence": 20433,
