      ],
      "en": "The LORD’s anger has scattered them. He will not pay attention to them any more. They didn’t respect the persons of the priests. They didn’t favor the elders.",
      "ko": "여호와께서 노하여 흩으시고 다시 권고치 아니하시리니 저희가 제사장들을 높이지 아니하였으며 장로들을 대접지 아니하였음이로다",
      "source_text_hash": "71a04076c5eec79a7c95ba6e1f95495d7a9f0eb814d571a6616a70834f9633d1",
      "translation_text_hash": "0d2f242f1daf077adfb3335a3ab6a4245a848806ee625844083ead2fc159d90c",
